  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;are equal, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now equating coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>729</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
